            "type": "game",
            "name": "Travel Riddles: Trip To Greece",
            "steam_appid": 654520,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "The birthplace of the western world awaits you. Travel to Greece and unlock its secrets, through a series of challenging riddles and puzzles!<br />\r\nThrough more than 8 episodes and 200 levels, a collection of 96 unique artifacts from the ancient world to the modern day are yours to collect. Make use of power-ups to set the best score!<br />\r\nJourney from the capital city of Athens, named after the goddess Athena, to the ancient sanctuary of Delphi, home to the oracle of Apollo, and to the religious complex of Meteora. Don’t forget to stop by and take in the beauty and wonder of the lava-pebbled beaches of Santorini!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n• Uncover more than 90 artifacts<br />\r\n• Learn the secrets of Greece through more than 200 levels.<br />\r\n• Travel to where it all began. The birthplace of western culture awaits.<br />\r\n• Beautiful locations throughout Mediterranean<br />\r\n• Travel through 8 unique episodes, from the capital city of Athens to the sanctuary at Delphi.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEvery level is more difficult than the last, but the pay-off and benefits revealed are more incredible than ever! Travel through one of the most beautiful countries in the world, whilst learning not only about the past, but the present!<br />\r\nYour journey around the world continues! Welcome to Greece! Where will your travels take you next?",
            "about_the_game": "The birthplace of the western world awaits you. Travel to Greece and unlock its secrets, through a series of challenging riddles and puzzles!<br />\r\nThrough more than 8 episodes and 200 levels, a collection of 96 unique artifacts from the ancient world to the modern day are yours to collect. Make use of power-ups to set the best score!<br />\r\nJourney from the capital city of Athens, named after the goddess Athena, to the ancient sanctuary of Delphi, home to the oracle of Apollo, and to the religious complex of Meteora. Don’t forget to stop by and take in the beauty and wonder of the lava-pebbled beaches of Santorini!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n• Uncover more than 90 artifacts<br />\r\n• Learn the secrets of Greece through more than 200 levels.<br />\r\n• Travel to where it all began. The birthplace of western culture awaits.<br />\r\n• Beautiful locations throughout Mediterranean<br />\r\n• Travel through 8 unique episodes, from the capital city of Athens to the sanctuary at Delphi.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEvery level is more difficult than the last, but the pay-off and benefits revealed are more incredible than ever! Travel through one of the most beautiful countries in the world, whilst learning not only about the past, but the present!<br />\r\nYour journey around the world continues! Welcome to Greece! Where will your travels take you next?",
            "short_description": "Travel to Greece and unlock its secrets, through a series of challenging riddles and puzzles! Through more than 8 episodes and 200 levels, a collection of 96 unique artifacts from the ancient world to the modern day are yours to collect. Make use of power-ups to set the best score!",
